Error [E0108]: The payload of `<corelib>/Core/encoding::Core/encoding/encoding.jet::DataEvent.Number` holds String (text), but this value is Int (a whole number)
  --> data_event_payload_types.jet:6:41
    |
  6 |     number :: encoding.DataEvent.Number(12)
    |                                         ^^
 Why: A variant payload keeps the type its enum declaration gives it
 Fix: Put the value in text with interpolation: "{x}"
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0108

Error [E0108]: The payload of `<corelib>/Core/encoding::Core/encoding/encoding.jet::DataEvent.Float` holds Float (an approximate binary number), but this value is String (text)
  --> data_event_payload_types.jet:7:39
    |
  7 |     float :: encoding.DataEvent.Float("1.5")
    |                                       ^^^^^
 Why: A variant payload keeps the type its enum declaration gives it
 Fix: Use Float (an approximate binary number) here
